{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00067", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"], "text": "S1纳入至少18岁、无已定义疾病的健康成人，并明确排除其所定义的肥胖、肌少症和身体衰弱；不能把这个人群范围自动扩展为青少年、疾病或衰弱人群已验证方案。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00067", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"], "text": "综述包括不同训练经历，但大量证据来自经验较少者。其群体结果仍需要按个人目标和情况调整，不能从没有病历推断健康，也不能将未提供训练经历当成已知。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "population_scope", "requested_relation": "scope", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-ADULT-SCOPE", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00067", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "failure_necessity", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00072", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00076"], "text": "这份健康成人综述认为，训练至瞬时肌肉力竭不是获得力量、肌肥大或功率收益的必要条件；这不等于无需足够努力，也不能推算个人最优余力。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "failure_necessity", "requested_relation": "necessity", "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-FAILURE", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00072", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00076"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "applicable_goals": ["strength", "hypertrophy", "general_fitness"], "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.3"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00025", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00026", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "S1将频次作为训练方案变量。其力量结果中频次有影响，但资料不足以确定完整剂量反应，而且总量相等时影响减弱。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00025", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00026", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "在该综述的肌肥大比较中，总训练量相等时不同频次未显示同样的额外优势。安排天数应与目标、总量和可执行性一并考虑，不能据此给所有人唯一最优频次。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "frequency", "requested_relation": "options", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-FREQUENCY-VOLUME", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00025", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00026", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "applicable_goals": ["strength", "hypertrophy"], "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.3"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00059", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00060", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "力量、肌肥大、功率和总体健康是不同目标；S1区分获得显著收益与追求最优收益，并强调按个人目标、经历和特点组织训练。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00001", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00006"], "text": "HHS成人章节给出总体健康层面的肌力活动建议；这不能自动成为某个人力量或增肌训练的唯一最优安排。选择目标之后，才可判断一条来源的范围是否相符。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "goal_scope", "requested_relation": "scope", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-GOAL-SCOPE", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00059", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00060", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}, {"source_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2", "source_version_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00001", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00006"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00012", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00014", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00015"], "text": "HHS建议逐步增加身体活动，结合当前体能和健康目标选择活动；增加量与通常活动量之间的差距以及适应、恢复都应考虑。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00012", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00014", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00015"], "text": "年龄、体能和既往经验影响个体化增加速度。正文的活动时间或百分比示例不是所有人的通用加重规则，也不能由这条指导确定下一档器械负重。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "gradual_progression", "requested_relation": "options", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-GRADUAL-PROGRESSION", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2", "source_version_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00012", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00014", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00015"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"goal": "public_health", "population": "adults", "time_scale": "gradual_activity_program"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"], "text": "S1明确说明综述汇总的是群体证据，需要按照个体需求和目标作适当调整；其汇总设计也不能直接排列各种完整方案的比较效果。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"], "text": "个人完成一次任务或随后出现变化，只能先记录为执行与观察事实。这些群体汇总结果本身不建立该次任务对这个人的因果获益，也不提供个人成功概率。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "individual_effect", "requested_relation": "inference", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-GROUP-INDIVIDUAL", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "在给定动作条件并接近疲劳的用力情况下，一组能够完成的重复次数与负荷存在反向关系；不同负荷后的次数不属于相同测试任务。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "因此换成更重配重后次数减少，本身不能直接证明个人力量退步。可先保留负荷和次数事实，再在可比任务及测量条件下评价变化；该综述不提供个人确定换算或成功概率。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "load_repetition_relation", "requested_relation": "explanation", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-LOAD-REPETITION", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "progression_options", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "渐进训练可调整负荷、训练量等变量，并结合个人目标；增加次数与调整负荷是不同任务选择。原则本身不能给出个人下一次的精确重量或保证完成。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "progression_options", "requested_relation": "options", "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-PROGRESSION", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "applicable_goals": ["strength", "hypertrophy", "general_fitness"], "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.3"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00060", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "这份健康成人综述明确区分“获得一些收益”和“追求持续的长期进展”：没有不断进阶，也不等于训练不可能带来收益。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00060", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "为追求持续的长期进展，可能需要逐步改变刺激；何时和怎样改变仍应结合目标、经验和个体情况，不能承诺某个人下次提高。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "progression_necessity", "requested_relation": "necessity", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-PROGRESSION-NECESSITY", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00060", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "health_frequency", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00001"], "text": "HHS第二版第4章（18–64岁成人）建议每周至少两天进行涉及主要肌群、中等或以上强度的肌力活动；这是总体健康建议，不能当作某个人力量或增肌训练的唯一最优频率。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "frequency", "requested_relation": "options", "routes": ["strength", "progression", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-PUBLIC-FREQUENCY", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2", "source_version_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00001"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"age_range": [18, 64], "goal": "public_health", "population": "adults", "time_scale": "weekly"}, "version": "1.4.3"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "rest", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00024", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "该综述的健康成人力量结果未显示所比较短长组间休息的一致差别；这是所纳入方案的群体结果，不能证明休息对所有任务都无效，或给每个人确定最佳间歇。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "rest", "requested_relation": "options", "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-REST", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00024", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "goal": "strength", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.3"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00025", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "S1在肌肥大结果中将组间休息列为资料不足、不能确定其影响的变量；不能把力量结果中所比较休息间隔的结论直接当作肌肥大结论。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00025", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "因此这份来源不能给出所有人的唯一最优休息时长；讨论休息应明确目标、任务和所比较的方案。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "rest", "requested_relation": "options", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-REST-HYPERTROPHY", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00025", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00069", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "goal": "hypertrophy", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "effort_precision", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00072", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00076"], "text": "原文讨论足够努力及一般RIR建议，同时明确现有证据不足以量化精确RIR或主观用力目标。不能据此给每个人指定精确余力，也不能把其他RPE量表直接换成RIR。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "effort_precision", "requested_relation": "precision", "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-RIR", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00072", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00076"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "applicable_goals": ["strength", "hypertrophy", "general_fitness"], "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.3"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"], "text": "训练适应具有刺激特异性；该综述通常将力量结果定义为与训练模式相同的随意等张1RM，测量对象和方法应随解释一并保留。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"], "text": "来源的一般特异性原则并未证明任意器械之间可直接换算；该综述也明确指出部分结果的测试方法差异没有纳入综合，测量方法应在解释中保留。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "comparability", "requested_relation": "scope", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-SPECIFICITY", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00062", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00070", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00012", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00017"], "text": "HHS指出，增加活动时出现新症状的人应咨询健康服务提供者；已知慢性病或症状会影响合适活动的种类和数量。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00012", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00017"], "text": "一般活动原则不能替代具体症状评估；疼痛或其他新症状不应被一条旧的健康成人训练原则当作正常状态忽略。这里不诊断病因，也不给自动减重比例。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "symptoms", "requested_relation": "scope", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-SYMPTOM-SCOPE", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2", "source_version_id": "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0", "span_ids": ["CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00012", "CORE-US-HHS-PAG-2:fulltext:0147d4dfc5ae76613a8b:hhs-chapters-4-7-text-1.4.0:s00017"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"goal": "public_health", "population": "adults", "time_scale": "current_symptoms_and_activity"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00063", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"], "text": "S1将周期组织视为有意改变负荷、组量、频次等变量的一种方式；现有综述不能将某种周期安排认定为所有健康成人获得收益的唯一必要做法。"}, {"part_id": "2", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00063", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"], "text": "在适当渐进负荷前提下，所汇总结果没有证明周期组织普遍明显优于非周期组织；具体目标的变量顺序和疲劳管理仍存在未充分研究之处。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "variation", "requested_relation": "necessity", "required_answer_parts": ["1", "2"], "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau", "recovery"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-VARIATION", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00061", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00063", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00075"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.2"}
{"answer_task": {"answer_complete": true, "answer_parts": [{"part_id": "volume", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00071", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"], "text": "该综述中较高组量与部分力量和肌肥大收益有关，但精确最优组数仍不能确定，额外收益可能递减。讨论组量须结合目标与当前计划，不能由总吨位直接推算肌肉刺激或统一加组。"}], "evidence_relation": "supports", "outcome": "volume", "requested_relation": "options", "routes": ["strength", "progression", "plateau"], "subject": "resistance_training"}, "claim_id": "CORE-CLAIM-VOLUME", "evidence_links": [{"source_id": "S1", "source_version_id": "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1", "span_ids": ["S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00011", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00071", "S1:fulltext:6e002198c43cecbb3a9b:jats-owned-text-1.4.1:s00074"]}], "reviewer_kind": "ai_assisted", "scope": {"aggregation": "group_evidence", "applicable_goals": ["strength", "hypertrophy", "general_fitness"], "population": "healthy_adults", "time_scale": "multiweek_programs"}, "version": "1.4.3"}
